      "notes": [
        {
          "text": "The tariff structure applies from 15 October 2025; the fuel surcharge on pilotage of USD 0.210310 per GT applies from 1 October 2026, so the version starts on 1 October 2026. The July 2026 addendum only changes a capacity figure in the introduction.",
          "source": {
            "document": "bpts-addendum-2026-07-15",
            "page": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "Coastal pilotage rates for container ships are garbled in the converted table ('INR 1 1 . 17', 'INR 2 2 .3 5'), so coastal container pilotage is not entered.",
          "source": {
            "document": "bpts-2025-10-15",
            "page": 26,
            "section": "IV.B (i)"
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "For ships up to 3,000 GT pilotage is a lump sum equal to the printed minimum; it is entered as a zero rate with that minimum.",
          "source": {
            "document": "bpts-2025-10-15",
            "page": 26,
            "section": "IV.B"
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "Port dues are payable to the Tamil Nadu Maritime Board in rupees for all ships, with a 10% surcharge that is not added automatically.",
          "source": {
            "document": "bpts-2025-10-15",
            "page": 26,
            "section": "IV.A"
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "Anchorage fees are payable to the Tamil Nadu Maritime Board, per day and only after the first 30 days (or from entry for idle ships); they are not entered.",
          "source": {
            "document": "bpts-2025-10-15",
            "page": 28,
            "section": "IV.J"
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "The berth hire minimum is per day and cannot be expressed in the format; it is not applied and only matters for small ships.",
          "source": {
            "document": "bpts-2025-10-15",
            "page": 27,
            "section": "IV.F"
          }
        }
